{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-skill-center#card-zh","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-skill-center","commit":"93ef4cced94605abecdfc4b017cf62ad442a3e5c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Skill Center（DSH 网页插件）：在 DSH 侧栏提供技能中心面板，并通过宿主技能目录和本机路由管理当前会话可见的技能。它支持按名称或描述搜索、按会话作用域浏览、查看 SKILL.md、调整模型与用户调用开关，以及新建技能、导入导出技能包和通过回收站恢复已删除技能；还提供 skill_create 模型工具和随包的 skill-authoring 指导技能。适合希望在 DSH 中整理、创作或迁移 Agent 技能的用户。操作会在本机受管技能目录读写技能文件，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:719-800","lib/index.js:1058-1205","lib/index.js:1563-1620","client/client.js:872-890"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-skill-center#card-en","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-skill-center","commit":"93ef4cced94605abecdfc4b017cf62ad442a3e5c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Skill Center is a DSH web panel for browsing session skills, reading SKILL.md, changing invocation switches, creating skills, importing and exporting bundles, and restoring deleted skills. It includes a skill_create tool and stores files in local managed roots; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:719-800","lib/index.js:1058-1205","lib/index.js:1563-1620","client/client.js:872-890"]}
