{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-skill-center#feature-1","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-skill-center","commit":"93ef4cced94605abecdfc4b017cf62ad442a3e5c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Skill Center 的功能「会话技能目录」：按当前会话作用域列出可见技能，并显示来源与调用策略。用户可切换要浏览的会话，也能搜索技能名称或描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:719-734","client/client.js:872-890"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-skill-center#feature-2","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-skill-center","commit":"93ef4cced94605abecdfc4b017cf62ad442a3e5c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Skill Center 的功能「技能调用开关」：打开技能详情后，可修改模型调用和用户调用策略；保存后将开关状态写回技能文件的 frontmatter。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:776-808","client/client.js:1040-1070"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-skill-center#feature-3","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-skill-center","commit":"93ef4cced94605abecdfc4b017cf62ad442a3e5c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Skill Center 的功能「技能包导入导出」：在技能详情中导出 ZIP，或选择 ZIP 与 Markdown 技能文件导入；目录包可带上附属资源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1058-1205","client/client.js:1070-1125"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-skill-center#feature-4","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-skill-center","commit":"93ef4cced94605abecdfc4b017cf62ad442a3e5c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Skill Center 的功能「技能回收站」：删除技能时将其移入同一技能根目录的 .trash；面板可浏览条目并恢复技能，也可永久清除回收站条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1350-1470","client/client.js:1135-1206"]}
